{
  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "healdene. Israhela bearn \u00e6ton hefonlice mete feowertig wintra, o\u00f0 hi comon to Chanaan lande. HI foron of Sin, \u00f0am westene, & wicodon on Rapfidim; \u00f0\u00e6r n\u00e6s nan w\u00e6ter. \u00d0a murcnodon hi ongean Moyses, & cw\u00e6don: Hwi l\u00e6ddes\u00f0u us ut of Egypta lande, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u woldest \u00d0a clypode Moyses to Drihtne, & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hu sceal ic don ymbe \u00f0is folc; Nu binnan lytlan fyrste \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Drihten to Moyse: Clypa to \u00f0e \u00fea yldestan on Israhela folce, & nim \u00f0a gyrde on \u00f0ine hand, & ic stande beforan \u00f0e uppon Oreb stane; & sleah \u00f0one stan, & \u00f0\u00e6t w\u00e6ter g\u00e6\u00f0 ut of him, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t & genemde \u00f0a stowe, Costnung, for Israhela bearna sace, for \u00f0an \u00fee hi cw\u00e6don: Is Drihten mid us \u00f0e Wytodlice Amaleh com & feaht ongean Israhela folc on Raphidim. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses to Iosue: Ceos \u00f0e geferan, & feoht ongean Amalech: ic stande to morgen uppon \u00f0is & Iosue dyde eal swa Moyses him bebead, & feaht ongean Amalech; witodlice Moyses & Aaron & \u00d0onne Moyses his handa up ahof, \u00f0onne h\u00e6fde Israhela folc sige; gyf he \u00feonne lytwhon slacode, \u00d0a Moyses handa w\u00e6ron werige, \u00f0a namon hi \u00e6nne stan & ledon undor hine; & he s\u00e6t uppon \u00f0am & Iosue af",
